# ==============================================================================
# Google Gemini API Key (Server-Side Only)
# ==============================================================================
# Get your API key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULES:
# 1. Never add `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix to GEMINI_API_KEY.
# 2. Never commit your actual key to git or expose it in client-side code.
# 3. For local development, copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your key.
# 4. For Vercel deployment, configure GEMINI_API_KEY in:
#    Project Settings -> Environment Variables -> Production & Preview.
#
# NOTE: If this key is not configured or rate-limited, the application will
# gracefully fall back to the built-in Kodansha Entry Sheet knowledge base
# and Web Speech API anime heroine synthesis, ensuring 100% uptime.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
